      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the text, using the words given.</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 66px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 35px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center; height: 35px;\"><strong>techniques</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center; height: 35px;\"><strong>weave</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center; height: 35px;\"><strong>harvest</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 31px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center; height: 31px;\"><strong>raise</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center; height: 31px;\"><strong>terraced</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center; height: 31px;\"><strong>industrial</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br>In ethnic villages of Vietnam, farming is very important for the economy. People grow crops on <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.1</label><input id='fbo-898290-0' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='0' name='fbo-898290-0' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-898290-0' /></span></strong> fields by using traditional farming <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.2</label><input id='fbo-898290-1' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='1' name='fbo-898290-1' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-898290-1' /></span></strong> to keep the soil&nbsp;healthy. Many families also grow <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.3</label><input id='fbo-898290-2' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='2' name='fbo-898290-2' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-898290-2' /></span></strong> trees like coffee and tea to earn money. During the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.4</label><input id='fbo-898290-3' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='3' name='fbo-898290-3' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-898290-3' /></span></strong>, everyone in the village works together to collect the crops. Families also <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.5</label><input id='fbo-898290-4' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='4' name='fbo-898290-4' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-898290-4' /></span></strong> livestock like chickens and cows, which give them food and help with farming. Women often <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.6</label><input id='fbo-898290-5' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='5' name='fbo-898290-5' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-898290-5' /></span></strong> beautiful fabrics, which they sell to support their families.&nbsp;</p>",
